 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? That's annoying. One of them is probably a cheap switch. Twist it off the cable rather than pulling it, and check the plug for wear. Good tip. The other is probably the coffee. Let's check the cheap one first. If replacing the plug solves it, the other must be it. Then it's the cheap switch. Replacing a plug is cheap and easy. Look on the side of the cup, usually. Press the power button on the laptop with one hand, and the plug with the other. Whichever one you press the button on first... Then it' definitely the cheap switch. Replacing a plug is cheap and easy, and the coffee can keep me warm while I do it.",
